        "description": "**Frontend Developer – IoT Dashboards** \n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**Company:** \n BoxTech\n \n\n\n\n**Job Type:** \n Full\\-Time \\| Remote\n \n\n\n\n**Experience:** \n 1–3 Years\n \n\n\n\n BoxTech is looking for a\n **Frontend Developer** \n to build modern, fast and scalable web applications with a strong focus on\n **IoT dashboards and real\\-time device monitoring** \n .\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n Key Responsibilities\n \n • Build responsive IoT dashboards and monitoring interfaces\n \n\n\n\n • Display live telemetry, sensor data and device status\n \n\n\n\n • Develop charts, graphs, gauges, KPI widgets and reports\n \n\n\n\n • Build GPS maps, live location and historical tracking views\n \n\n\n\n • Create alarm, event and notification interfaces\n \n\n\n\n • Integrate REST APIs and real\\-time data using WebSockets\n \n\n\n\n • Handle large and frequently updating datasets efficiently\n \n\n\n\n • Build reusable and scalable frontend components\n \n\n\n\n • Work closely with backend, IoT and UI/UX teams\n \n\n\n\n • Optimize dashboard speed, performance and usability\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n Required Skills\n \n • Strong experience with\n **React / Next.js** \n\n\n\n\n • Experience building dashboards or monitoring systems\n \n\n\n\n • REST API and WebSocket integration\n \n\n\n\n • Charts and data visualization\n \n\n\n\n • Maps and location\\-based interfaces\n \n\n\n\n • State management and frontend performance optimization\n \n\n\n\n • Strong UI/UX attention and ability to implement designs accurately\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n Preferred\n \n TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, MQTT concepts, time\\-series data, GPS tracking, telemetry systems and experience with SaaS or IoT platforms.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n 📩 Candidates should share their\n **CV, GitHub and examples of dashboards or web applications** \n they have developed.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n* \\#Hiring \\#FrontendDeveloper \\#IoT \\#IoTDashboard \\#ReactJS \\#NextJS \\#WebSockets \\#GPS \\#Telematics \\#BoxTech",
